{
  "schema": "pelican.studio_scenario",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "gui_build_music",
  "description": "GB-4 target 2 (music), from File > New Project > Blank with Studio's GUI only. A short quiet WAV is written outside the project (a file step, as a person has a file on disk; 8-bit PCM whose every byte is ASCII, so the step's text write is byte-exact, about -24 dBFS, 2 s) and File > Import Sound... copies it into the project's assets/audio (UX-8 decision 9). The palette's audio.playback arrives on that sound and on the scene clock (Q-10 / Q-11); Bus and Wrap are picked with the keyboard (bgm, repeat). The Sound list's Import... copies the same file again, as pulse_2.wav, and the voice plays it. The palette's audio.volume asks which voice it drives (UX-8 decision 7) and arrives on it at 1; the palette's value.curve (a ramp from 0 to 1 over a second) is drawn onto the volume's value: a fade in. The scenario is silent (the driver names the null backend, get_status audio says so); whether the voice runs is read from its published value (get_graph_node_values: audio_playback.voice is the voice's elapsed seconds): 0 in edit, it runs with Play and equals the scene clock, it stands still while paused, and Stop puts it back to 0; the fade's curve runs from 0 up to 1 with it. The Timeline follows the voice with nothing in Values from (UX-8 decision 6): with Live on, a press at the strip's left end while paused moves the scene clock back and the voice with it. UX-9: the palette and the dialog that asks for the voice are answered as they close (no wait for a dialog loop after Return or OK); the voice's state is the band under audio_playback (get_status audio.voices, engine CT-1): nothing in edit, `playing · <s> s` while it plays; Play, Stop and Play again, and the second run's position_seconds is read as it starts (remembered, not required: the voice should start again from the top). Typed: the project folder and name, the sound's path in the import dialog (twice), and the palette's filters.",
  "tab": "frame_plan",
  "probe_no_automation": false,
  "steps": [
    {"label": "the fixture's engine is up", "cmd": "wait_engine", "timeout_ms": 180000},
    {"label": "File > New Project...", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.file.newProject"},
    {"label": "the dialog is on screen", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.newProjectDialog", "timeout_ms": 10000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the folder: this run's own artifacts", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.newProject.location", "text": "{artifacts}"},
    {"label": "the name", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.newProject.name", "text": "gb_music"},
    {"label": "the Blank pipeline template", "cmd": "select", "name": "pelican.newProject.template", "text": "Blank pipeline"},
    {"label": "Create", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.newProject.create"},
    {"label": "the dialog closed", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.newProjectDialog", "timeout_ms": 10000, "missing": true},
    {"label": "the blank project's present is on the Frame Plan canvas", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.framePlanLogicalView::node#present", "timeout_ms": 180000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the new engine answers and has presented frames", "cmd": "wait_engine", "timeout_ms": 180000, "frames": 30},
    {"label": "the Graph tab is in front", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.view.renderTools.graph"},
    {"label": "the canvas can edit the new document", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "a short quiet WAV outside the project (8-bit, every byte ASCII so a text write is byte-exact)", "file": "write", "path": "{artifacts}/incoming/pulse.wav", "text": "RIFF$>\u0000\u0000WAVEfmt \u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0001\u0000\u0001\u0000@\u001f\u0000\u0000@\u001f\u0000\u0000\u0001\u0000\b\u0000data\u0000>\u0000\u0000vwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{"},
    {"label": "Show: Value", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasShow.value"},
    {"label": "Show: Audio", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasShow.audio"},
    {"label": "File > Import Sound... (decision 9)", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.file.importSound"},
    {"label": "the import dialog", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.audioImportDialog", "timeout_ms": 20000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "File > Import Sound: the file's path", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.audioImportDialog.fileName", "text": "{artifacts}/incoming/pulse.wav"},
    {"label": "Return opens it", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.audioImportDialog.fileName", "sequence": "Return"},
    {"label": "the dialog's loop ends", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 400, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "the dialog closed", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.audioImportDialog", "timeout_ms": 20000, "missing": true},
    {"label": "imported", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 20000, "contains": "project://assets/audio/pulse.wav"},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "Add: the palette opens (audio.playback)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode"},
    {"label": "the palette is on screen", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPalette", "timeout_ms": 10000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the filter: audio.playback", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter", "text": "audio.playback"},
    {"label": "Enter in the filter is OK", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter", "sequence": "Return"},
    {"label": "audio_playback is drawn", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node#audio_playback", "timeout_ms": 120000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "the voice plays the imported sound", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[1].parameters.asset", "value": "project://assets/audio/pulse.wav", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "on the scene clock the palette put beside it", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[0].parameters.name", "value": "scene_time"},
    {"label": "its time is that clock", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[1].inputs.time.node", "value": "scene_time"},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "fit", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"},
    {"label": "pick the voice", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node_header#audio_playback"},
    {"label": "its Sound / Bus / Wrap fields", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAudioRow", "timeout_ms": 30000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "Sound names the WAV", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAudioAsset", "timeout_ms": 30000, "text": "project://assets/audio/pulse.wav"},
    {"label": "Bus: one down (se -> bgm), from the keyboard", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAudioBus", "sequence": "Down"},
    {"label": "bus bgm", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[1].parameters.bus", "value": "bgm", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "let it settle", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 1000, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "Wrap: one down (once -> repeat)", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAudioWrap", "sequence": "Down"},
    {"label": "wrap repeat", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[1].parameters.wrap", "value": "repeat", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "let it settle", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 1000, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "pick the voice", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node_header#audio_playback"},
    {"label": "its Import...", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAudioImport", "timeout_ms": 30000, "visible": true, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "the Sound list's Import...", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAudioImport"},
    {"label": "the import dialog", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.audioImportDialog", "timeout_ms": 20000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the Sound list's Import: the file's path", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.audioImportDialog.fileName", "text": "{artifacts}/incoming/pulse.wav"},
    {"label": "Return opens it", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.audioImportDialog.fileName", "sequence": "Return"},
    {"label": "the dialog's loop ends", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 400, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "the dialog closed", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.audioImportDialog", "timeout_ms": 20000, "missing": true},
    {"label": "the same name again is pulse_2, and the voice plays it", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[1].parameters.asset", "value": "project://assets/audio/pulse_2.wav", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "pick nothing (the volume asks for its voice anyway)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasRefresh"},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "Add: the palette opens (audio.volume)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode"},
    {"label": "the palette is on screen", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPalette", "timeout_ms": 10000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the filter: audio.volume", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter", "text": "audio.volume"},
    {"label": "Enter in the filter is OK", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter", "sequence": "Return"},
    {"label": "the dialog asks which voice (decision 7)", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasRequired", "timeout_ms": 20000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the voice there is the one", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasRequired.voice", "timeout_ms": 10000, "text": "audio_playback"},
    {"label": "OK", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasRequired.ok"},
    {"label": "the dialog closed", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasRequired", "timeout_ms": 20000, "missing": true},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "the volume drives the voice", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[3].inputs.voice.node", "value": "audio_playback", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "from a constant 1 (full volume)", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[2].parameters.value", "value": 1},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "Add: the palette opens (value.curve)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode"},
    {"label": "the palette is on screen", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPalette", "timeout_ms": 10000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the filter: value.curve", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter", "text": "value.curve"},
    {"label": "Enter in the filter is OK", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter", "sequence": "Return"},
    {"label": "value_curve is drawn", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node#value_curve", "timeout_ms": 120000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "a ramp from 0 to 1 on the scene clock that is there", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[4].inputs.time.node", "value": "scene_time", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "the curve is drawn", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node#value_curve", "timeout_ms": 60000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "fit", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"},
    {"label": "let it settle", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 800, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "the curve onto the volume's value: a fade in", "cmd": "drag", "from": {"name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#value_curve/out:value"}, "to": {"name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#audio_volume/in:value"}, "steps": 10},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "the volume reads the curve", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[3].inputs.value.node", "value": "value_curve", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "the scenario is silent: the null backend", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_status", "params": {}, "path": "audio.backend", "value": "null"},
    {"label": "edit: the voice has not moved", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[0].outputs.voice", "value": 0, "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "what the root's nodes publish (read in full)", "cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}},
    {"label": "fit", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"},
    {"label": "pick the voice", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node_header#audio_playback"},
    {"label": "Timeline", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphTimelineToggle"},
    {"label": "the strip", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphTimeline", "timeout_ms": 20000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "Live", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLive"},
    {"label": "the strip reads the voice, nothing in Values from (decision 6)", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphTimelineSummary", "timeout_ms": 60000, "contains": "audio_playback.voice"},
    {"label": "press Play", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.play.play"},
    {"label": "playing", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.playStatus", "timeout_ms": 30000, "contains": "Playing"},
    {"label": "playing: the voice runs", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[0].outputs.voice", "op": "gt", "value": 1.0, "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "press Pause", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.play.pause"},
    {"label": "paused", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.playStatus", "timeout_ms": 10000, "contains": "Paused"},
    {"label": "let it settle", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 1000, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "paused, read the voice", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[0].outputs.voice", "remember": "voice_paused"},
    {"label": "60 frames paused (read)", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_status", "params": {}}, "path": "result.frame", "remember": "_delay1"},
    {"label": "60 frames paused", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_status", "params": {}}, "path": "result.frame", "op": "ge", "value_of": "_delay1", "plus": 60, "retry_ms": 120000},
    {"label": "paused: the voice stands still", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[0].outputs.voice", "value_of": "voice_paused"},
    {"label": "paused: the voice is at the scene clock", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[3].outputs.value", "value_of": "voice_paused"},
    {"label": "past a second, the fade's curve is up at 1", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[4].outputs.value", "value": 1},
    {"label": "scrub: a press at the strip's left end", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphTimeline", "point": [3, 20]},
    {"label": "the voice went back with the scene clock", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[0].outputs.voice", "op": "lt", "value_of": "voice_paused", "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "the scrubbed voice, read", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[0].outputs.voice", "remember": "voice_scrubbed"},
    {"label": "and it is the scene clock the strip set", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[3].outputs.value", "value_of": "voice_scrubbed"},
    {"label": "and the fade is back down with it", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[4].outputs.value", "op": "lt", "value": 1, "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "the strip names the voice it follows", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphTimelineSummary", "timeout_ms": 10000, "contains": "audio_playback.voice"},
    {"label": "a picture of the window (paused, scrubbed)", "expect": "screenshot", "path": "gui_build_music_window.png"},
    {"label": "Live off", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLive"},
    {"label": "press Stop", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.play.play"},
    {"label": "edit again", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.playStatus", "timeout_ms": 30000, "text": "Edit"},
    {"label": "stopped: the voice is back at 0", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[0].outputs.voice", "value": 0, "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "UX-9 decision 4: edit -- get_status says the voice is idle", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_status", "params": {}, "path": "audio.voices[0].state", "value": "idle", "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "and its band says nothing of it (idle is not shown in edit)", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "text", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_layer_band#audio_playback"}, "path": "text", "op": "excludes", "value": "idle", "retry_ms": 10000},
    {"label": "Play again", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.play.play"},
    {"label": "playing", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.playStatus", "timeout_ms": 30000, "contains": "Playing"},
    {"label": "get_status: the voice plays", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_status", "params": {}, "path": "audio.voices[0].state", "value": "playing", "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "the band under the voice says playing and where", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "text", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_layer_band#audio_playback"}, "path": "text", "op": "contains", "value": "playing · ", "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "let it play a moment", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 1500, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "the first run's position (read)", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_status", "params": {}}, "path": "result.audio.voices[0].position_seconds", "remember": "first_position"},
    {"label": "Stop", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.play.play"},
    {"label": "edit again", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.playStatus", "timeout_ms": 30000, "text": "Edit"},
    {"label": "Play a second time", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.play.play"},
    {"label": "playing again", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.playStatus", "timeout_ms": 30000, "contains": "Playing"},
    {"label": "get_status: the voice plays again", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_status", "params": {}, "path": "audio.voices[0].state", "value": "playing", "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "the second Play's position, read as it starts (near 0: the voice starts from the top, not from where the first run stopped; read, not required)", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_status", "params": {}}, "path": "result.audio.voices[0].position_seconds", "remember": "second_position"},
    {"label": "Stop", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.play.play"},
    {"label": "edit at the end", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.playStatus", "timeout_ms": 30000, "text": "Edit"},
    {"label": "a picture of the Graph tab", "expect": "screenshot", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas", "path": "gui_build_music_graph.png"}
  ]
}
